<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Tomkor buys three properties from Southern.</title>
<headline>Tomkor buys three properties from Southern.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Tomkor Properties Ltd said on Wednesday it had bought three shopping centres from Southern Life Ltd for about 140 million rand.</p>
<p>The centres are all located in South Africa's highly industrialised Gauteng province. The sale marks part of Southern's strategy of reducing its direct exposure to property.</p>
<p>The deal will be settled the issue of Tomkor scrip for 60 percent of the price-tag with the remainder being paid in cash.</p>
